                                "sense_id": "0aa6625f-aac7-356a-8fda-83ba12c8ca85",
                                "text": "At present, however, the Long Beach resident has more than records on his mind, mainly getting a representative U.S. team to the 1964 \"paralympics\" to be held in Tokyo Nov. 8–12. [Frank] Vecera is on a fund-raising drive for the six California athletes selected to perform on this year's team. The tab for transporting the six to Tokyo is $3,900."
                            }
